  "bio": "Curtis Aldrich is a highly skilled tattoo artist hailing from Winter Park, Florida, specializing in the vibrant and dynamic styles of newschool, illustrative, and neotraditional tattoos. He is renowned for his professionalism, ensuring each client receives a bespoke experience from consultation to the final reveal of their custom ink. Reach out to Curtis at caldrich1@gmail.com for inquiries, as he prefers to maintain professional communication through email rather than direct messages.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location:\n\n-Books Temporarily Open\n-Orlando, FL. Artist Est. 2011 \n-Email: caldrich1@gmail.com -@built4speedtattoo\n-Newsletter & Updates ⬇️",
